<title>USA: Standard Pacific Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Standard Pacific Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
<p> Revenues				     $111,303	  $61,584</p>
<p> Net income					3,517		573</p>
<p> Net income per share			    .12		.02</p>
<p>Weighted average common and</p>
<p> equivalent shares outstanding	29,705,032     30,064,232</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the rise in Q1 1997 earnings was primarily due to increased deliveries and higher margins from its California homebuilding operations.</p>
</text>
